{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 93978, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 66354, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "12.9暗WB组队攻略", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1639052366, "updated_at": 1639322454, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1639322454, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 0, "status": 1, "summary": "对策是4连百分比刀，不点火就有很大发挥，但是吃加值1.BOSS难点NS1体BUFF解除，前排全体分解，SS前排BUFF爆发，DS前排全体BUFF解除，10秒魅惑（无法上BUFF），自带DEBUFF持续", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6447, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 93978, "content": "<div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">对策是4连百分比刀，不点火就有很大发挥，但是吃加值</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">1.BOSS难点</p></div><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">NS1体BUFF解除，前排全体分解，SS前排BUFF爆发，DS前排全体BUFF解除，10秒魅惑（无法上BUFF），自带DEBUFF持续时间-20%。</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※应对策略：狗哥最佳选择，减速+退DS条，次选老板娘，谁高加上谁</span><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※应对策略：轮滑妹，减益延长天子（上你建议延长时间最长的天子），或者全员妨害带新魂卡</span><br></span></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">1.刀选择</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">光狗、亚里亚、对策，当然实际还是看你有什么刀就上什么。</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">2.DS设置</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※不带火莫娜：1.墨丘利 &nbsp; 2.光豹&nbsp; &nbsp;3.光双刃<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※带火莫娜：<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">1.火莫娜&nbsp; &nbsp;2.<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">墨丘利</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;3.光双刃</span></span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">3.队长设置</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">※首选光月月，S命中附魔不多（少于5个）选火妈或对眼<br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">※对策+3以上选对策队长，放弃光琴换光莫娜</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(0,182,79);width:calc(100%-1px);\"><p class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-size:14px;background:transparent;color:rgb(255,255,255);font-weight:bold;width:auto;\">4.新人扛不住</p></div><br style=\"\"></div><div style=\"font-size:14px;background:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(0,0,0);\">上狗哥，光系全扔后排，前排全带血防礼装，多余的贵公子魂卡给复活奶，再顶不住上水炮或木盾，换下低加露娜。<br></div></div><div>有狗哥或者老板娘在，基本不会死。</div><div><br></div><div data-col=\"11\" class=\"selectItem mould-table-wrap\" contenteditable=\"false\" model-id=\"73722\" data-insertcount=\"0\" data-select=\"[]\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"table-container\">\n                                  <div class=\"table-overflow\">\n                                    \n                                    \n                                    \n                                    <table class=\"mould-table selectItemTable col-group-table\" style=\"width: 758px;\">\n                                      <colgroup><col style=\"width: 63px;\"><col style=\"width: 71px;\"><col style=\"width: 70px;\"><col style=\"width: 70px;\"><col style=\"width: 69px;\"><col style=\"width: 69px;\"><col style=\"width:62px;\"><col style=\"width:62px;\"><col style=\"width: 74px;\"><col style=\"width: 75px;\"><col style=\"width: 73px;\"></colgroup>\n                                      <tbody>\n                                        \n                                      <tr style=\"height: 70px;\"><td class=\"\"><div class=\"td\" style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\">天子1</div></td><td class=\"\"><div style=\"min-height: 20px; width: auto;\" class=\"td\"><img style=\"object-fit: contain; width: 52px; height: 52px; display: block; margin: auto;\" data-re